  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.DataStructures.GameSession.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Central game session data - single source of truth for all game state
Stores playtime data in serializable fields while providing TimeService integration
Ensures playtime persists correctly across save/load operations</p>
</div>
